      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plainfield%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Vandalia Railroad ran just north of Plainfield in 1850‑51, and today a 4.6‑mile segment of the Vandalia Trail follows its old right‑of‑way.",
